{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":13677392,"ns":0,"title":"Solar Energy Materials and Solar Cells","revisions":[{"revid":1336277301,"parentid":1318822684,"minor":true,"timestamp":"2026-02-02T21:54:00Z","size":2548,"sha1":"f9609a6239959cb78bc1d01e8df8ab2561fd13a8","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"{{Infobox Journal\n| title        = Solar Energy Materials and Solar Cells\n| cover        = Solar Energy Materials and Solar Cells.gif\n| abbreviation =  Sol. Energy Mater. Sol. Cells\n| discipline   = [[Solar cell]]s\n| editor       = Ivan Gordon\n| website      = https://www.elsevier.com/wps/find/journaldescription.cws_home/505675/description#description\n| publisher    = [[Elsevier]]\n| country      = The [[Netherlands]]\n| history      = 1968-present\n| link1        = http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/journal/09270248\n| link1-name   = Online access\n| eISSN        =\n| ISSN         = 0927-0248\n| impact       = 7.267\n| impact-year  = 2020\n| frequency    = Monthly\n}}\n'''''Solar Energy Materials and Solar Cells''''' is a [[scientific journal]]  published by [[Elsevier]] covering research related to [[solar energy]] materials and [[solar cells]]. According to the ''[[Journal Citation Reports]]'', ''Solar Energy Materials and Solar Cells'' has a 2020 [[impact factor]] of 7.267.<ref name=WoS>{{cite book |year=2021 |chapter=Solar Energy Materials and Solar Cells |title=2020 Journal Citation Reports |publisher=[[Thomson Reuters]] |edition=Science |series=[[Web of Science]] |title-link=Journal Citation Reports }}</ref>\n\n== Controversies ==\nA paper titled \"Ageing effects of perovskite solar cells under different environmental factors and electrical load conditions\" published in 2018 in the journal<ref>{{Cite Q | Q56237061 }}</ref> corresponded to a paper previously published in the journal ''[[Nature Energy]]'' as \"Systematic investigation of the impact of operation conditions on the degradation behaviour of perovskite solar cells\".<ref>{{Cite Q | Q56237071}}</ref>\nIt led to an investigation of [[plagiarism]].<ref>{{Cite web\n | title = Elsevier investigating paper on solar cells that appears to plagiarize a Nature journal\n | url =https://retractionwatch.com/2018/08/23/elsevier-investigating-paper-on-solar-cells-that-appears-to-plagiarize-a-nature-journal/\n | date = 2018-08-23\n | work = Retraction Watch\n}}</ref>\n\n==See also==\n* [[List of periodicals published by Elsevier]]\n\n== References ==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n== External links ==\n* {{Official website|1=http://sdos.ejournal.ascc.net/cgi-bin/sciserv.pl?collection=journals&journal=09270248}}\n\n[[Category:Elsevier academic journals]]\n[[Category:Energy and fuel journals]]\n[[Category:English-language journals]]\n[[Category:Materials science journals]]\n[[Category:Monthly journals]]\n[[Category:Academic journals established in 1968]]\n[[Category:Solar energy]]\n\n\n{{energy-journal-stub}}"}}}],"contentmodel":"wikitext","pagelanguage":"en","pagelanguagehtmlcode":"en","pagelanguagedir":"ltr","touched":"2026-11-17T19:36:53Z","lastrevid":1336277301,"length":2548}]}}